     kamishibai   set up two things                                                             
                                                                                                
    kamishibai turns a list of words you want to learn into an anki deck plus a printable       
    pdf. for each word it writes a natural example sentence, illustrates the scene as a         
    manga panel, and reads it aloud in a natural, native-speaker voice.                         
                                                                                                
    01  your language     EN    English                                                         
                                                                                                
    02  gemini api key  › paste your key [Cmd+V]                                                
                          ───────────────────────────────────────                               
                                                                                                
                           submit     load from env                                             
                                                      ai may be wrong, please verify results    
                                                                                                
    step 2/2                           [Enter] submit  [← →] move  [Esc] back  [Ctrl+C] quit
